      "source": [
        "# test-writer: замер эффекта навыка\n",
        "\n",
        "Один и тот же агент пишет тесты к 10 модулям в двух условиях:\n",
        "- **baseline** — без навыка (может писать и запускать тесты);\n",
        "- **skill** — с навыком `test-writer` (инструкция, справочники и скрипт mutation testing).\n",
        "\n",
        "Качество тестов измеряется mutation score: сколько внесённых в код багов тесты ловят."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "UmtAqG1Pnt1Y"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 1. Код и зависимости"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "2mzDTIO6nt1Y",
        "outputId": "74583aca-927a-4177-8cc4-a73794a8f40f",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        }
      },
      "execution_count": 4,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "/content\n",
            "fatal: destination path 'test-writer' already exists and is not an empty directory.\n",
            "/content/test-writer\n",
            "  Installing build dependencies ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n",
            "  Checking if build backend supports build_editable ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n",
            "  Getting requirements to build editable ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n",
            "  Preparing editable metadata (pyproject.toml) ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n",
            "  Building editable for twbench (pyproject.toml) ... \u001b[?25l\u001b[?25hdone\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "REPO = \"https://github.com/sofetizm/test-writer.git\"\n",
        "%cd /content\n",
        "!git clone -q $REPO test-writer || (cd test-writer && git pull -q)\n",
        "%cd /content/test-writer\n",
        "!pip install -q -r requirements.txt && pip install -q -e ."
      ]
    },
